Orders are lined up for you. Pro creates each order from your plan: the switches, the new SIPs and the staged cash deployment. They appear under Home → Mutual Funds → Invest in the app, in your Novelty Wealth Transactions.
You review and confirm. Open each order, check the fund, amount and any exit-load or tax note, then place it.
Some orders go to External Transactions. Many of your funds, mostly the Regular plans, can't be traded in the app. Those orders go to your External Transactions list, with the reason shown. You place them at the fund house or on another platform.
SIPs are external for now. In-app SIPs are coming to Novelty Wealth soon. Until then, your ₹1 lac a month SIPs go to your External Transactions list with the amount and fund. You set them up at the fund house or another platform.
We track what's done. You mark each order placed or done, and we keep the plan in step with that.
What it could look like for you
Start the new SIPs in the Growth funds chosen in Step 3.
Move your extra cash into Growth in a few staged instalments.
Switch Regular plans to Direct over several years, each year's switches sized to the ₹1.25 lac tax-free allowance.
